<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Additional Experiment Results</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We present the additional experimental results in this section.</p>
</div>
<section id="A4.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">D.1 </span>Full results on MKG-W and MKG-Y</h3>

<div id="A4.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In our experiments, we present the MRR and Hits@1 results in Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4 Experiment ‣ Tokenization, Fusion and Decoupling: Bridging the Granularity Mismatch Between Large Language Models and Knowledge Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>. We now present the results for the complete set of four metrics in both datasets in the Table <a href="#A4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ D.1 Full results on MKG-W and MKG-Y ‣ Appendix D Additional Experiment Results ‣ Tokenization, Fusion and Decoupling: Bridging the Granularity Mismatch Between Large Language Models and Knowledge Graphs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T7" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A4.T7.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A4.T7.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" rowspan="2"><span id="A4.T7.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Methods</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_tt" colspan="4"><span id="A4.T7.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MKG-W</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="4"><span id="A4.T7.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MKG-Y</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MRR</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@1</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@3</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@10</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MRR</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@1</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@3</span></td>
<td id="A4.T7.2.2.8" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="A4.T7.2.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">H@10</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A4.T7.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A4.T7.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_r ltx_border_t"><span id="A4.T7.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">TransE</span></td>
